---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Terms of Service" description="The terms for using Trying, Together.">
  <section class="wrap narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>

    <h2>Not medical advice</h2>
    <p>
      Trying, Together provides general information and gentle guidance to help you track and understand
      fertility. It is not a medical device and does not provide medical advice, diagnosis or treatment.
      Always consult a qualified clinician about your health and any decisions related to conception.
    </p>

    <h2>Your account</h2>
    <p>
      You’re responsible for keeping your login secure and for the accuracy of the information you enter.
      You must be old enough to form a binding contract in your jurisdiction to use the service.
    </p>

    <h2>Subscriptions</h2>
    <p>
      Pro is an auto-renewing subscription billed through the App Store or Google Play. You can manage or
      cancel it in your store account settings; cancellation takes effect at the end of the current period.
    </p>

    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>
      Don’t misuse the service, attempt to breach its security, or use it to harm others. We may suspend
      access that violates these terms.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      We may update these terms as the product evolves and will note material changes in the app or on this
      page.
    </p>

    <p class="note muted">
      This is a plain-language summary reviewed by counsel before public launch. Contact
      legal@tryingtogether.app with questions.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .narrow { max-width: 760px; }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); }
  .note { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 0.9rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 18px; }
</style>
